red index when you often ask for the entities whose property lies between two","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"values, such as the ones whose health runs low, or visit entities in the order of a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"property, such as drawing them back to front:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["var world = World()","let weak = world.spawn(Health(current: 2))","let weaker = world.spawn(Health(current: 1))","world.spawn(Health(current: 9))","world.index(ordered: \\Health.current)","","print(world.lookup(\\Health.current, in: ...3) == [weaker, weak])","\/\/ Prints \"true\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An ordered index is kept current the same way as an index by value ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/index(_:)-u1gw"},{"type":"text","text":"):"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spawning, inserting, removing and despawning update it; a change in place leaves it out of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"date until the next "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/advanceChangeTick()"},{"type":"text","text":", and until then "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/lookup(_:in:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/entities(sortedBy:)"},{"type":"text","text":" walk and sort the storage, so their answers are always current."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Keeping it costs O(log "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":") for each insert, removal and despawn of an entity holding a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoic